{"id":841817,"title":"14｜Add Model","content":"本节课讲解如何在系统中添加并使用第三方大模型。首先，通过配置界面的“add model”功能输入新模型名称，并确保该名称与第三方平台提供的接口地址匹配。接着，在第三方网站如Silicon Floor上注册账号并完成实名认证，获取免费的大模型使用权及API密钥。将API密钥和URL地址填入系统配置中后，点击验证按钮检查是否有效。若遇到验证失败，需确认所选模型在第三方平台上存在且正确勾选。实验表明，新增加的大模型仅能在特定模式下（如chat模式）正常工作，而不能应用于其他模式（如composer模式）。最后，课程提醒用户在恢复原有模型列表时关闭自定义API选项以避免访问错误。至此，基础部分的学习告一段落，后续章节将进入实战环节，通过具体案例加深对知识的理解。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397813,"user_name":"roychris","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1092091,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"C7D786EEEAA830","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eqjbPAydn9KYz72XEUfREJ7VV4xYSSxA9fdqicEeic1LfuWbXXicOL8sMys1xG6CTUkyDs14mrzpe8JQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739629839,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144323,"content":"Cursor就是这么设计的哈，不能在composer里使用。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1739758932,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397813,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师，为何Qwen&#47;Qwen2.5大模型不能在composer中使用？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657290,"discussion_content":"Cursor就是这么设计的哈，不能在composer里使用。","content_length":30,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739758932,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397510,"user_name":"gesanri","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1121174,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"AE3B97DC3ED668","u